{"id":"vod_bf_24049","vodId":"24049","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"魔物娘的同居日常","name_cn":"魔物娘的同居日常","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-25/849e8163331b6e1db794d34cf233e351.jpg"},"summary":"这是一个魔物和人类共存的世界，长久以来，魔物们都隐藏在黑暗中不被人类知晓，然而，“种族间交流法案”的颁布和实施让这个初看有些可怕但实际上人畜无害的种族走出了幕后，走入了人类社会。　　来留主公人（间岛淳司 配音）是一个性格温吞没有坏心眼的平凡男子，法案的颁布彻底改变了他平淡的生活。活泼开朗大大咧咧的半蛇人米亚（雨宫天 配音）、个性呆萌整日里迷迷糊糊的鹰身人帕皮（小泽亚李 配音）、高贵典雅重情重义的人马珊卓雷雅（相川奈都姬 配音）、存在感微弱有着双重性格的史莱姆族丝（野村真悠华 配音），这些可爱的人魔娘们接二连三的光临来留的家中，充满了欢笑的同居生活就此拉开序幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 17:57:46","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mowuniangdetongjurichang/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mowuniangdetongjurichang/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/202410282s2086j4index.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/mowuniangdetongjurichang/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mowuniangdetongjurichang/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241028fmk8R9P3index.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/mowuniangdetongjurichang/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mowuniangdetongjurichang/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241028lp4JQIb8index.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mowuniangdetongjurichang/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241028MXzdVDuFindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/mowuniangdetongjurichan